WEBVTT

00:04:28.625 --> 00:04:31.514
SK: Ways that didn't include
you hiding your credit card bill

00:04:31.528 --> 00:04:33.863
or deleting that toll-free number
from your phone.

00:04:33.887 --> 00:04:37.505
These spaces of old
were so important for women.

00:04:37.529 --> 00:04:40.379
TKM: There were African sexual practices
that centered women

00:04:40.403 --> 00:04:42.482
and in particular, their pleasure.

00:04:42.506 --> 00:04:44.950
SK: And we're going to talk
about one in particular

00:04:44.974 --> 00:04:46.847
that's named "osunality."

00:04:46.871 --> 00:04:49.586
TKM: Also known as the African erotic.

00:04:49.610 --> 00:04:52.688
Yes, my people,
welcome to the Thunderdome.

00:04:52.712 --> 00:04:55.070
The erotic takes on
different shapes and forms

00:04:55.094 --> 00:04:57.180
as you travel the globe.

00:04:57.204 --> 00:04:59.180
Now let's take a bow to the "Kama Sutra,"

00:04:59.204 --> 00:05:03.268
the world's first book on the pleasures
of sensual living.